This repository contains GPL-2.0-only documentation and helper scripts.

NVIDIA's 390.157 driver source and installer are not included. They must be
downloaded from NVIDIA and remain subject to NVIDIA's license.

The helper script downloads, but does not redistribute, compatibility patches
from the Arch User Repository's nvidia-390xx-utils package. Patch authors and
their provenance are recorded by that package's PKGBUILD. Those patches retain
their respective licensing terms.
